---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Cookies – Fettle London" description="A short site with a light touch. We use only what keeps it working – nothing that follows you around.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Cookies</h1>
        <p class="lede">A short site with a light touch. We use only what keeps it working &ndash; nothing that follows you around.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="muted">Last updated 10 October 2026.</p>

          <h2>What we use</h2>
          <p>Fettle&rsquo;s site uses a small number of essential cookies and local storage &ndash; the sort that remember your place on the page and keep the site running. Nothing more is needed to browse or to check availability.</p>

          <h2>What we don&rsquo;t use</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>No advertising or third-party tracking cookies.</li>
            <li>No selling of browsing data to anyone.</li>
            <li>No profiles built to follow you across other sites.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Analytics</h2>
          <p>We use Vercel Web Analytics to count visits anonymously, so we can see which pages help. It uses no cookies, stores nothing on your device and never identifies you by name.</p>

          <h2>Fonts and other services</h2>
          <p>Our fonts are hosted on our own site, so browsing doesn&rsquo;t send your details to a font service. The postcode check sends only the postcode you type to Postcodes.io to confirm it&rsquo;s real. More detail is on our <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a>.</p>

          <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
          <p>You can clear or block cookies in your browser settings at any time. The essential ones only keep the site tidy, so blocking them may make a few things behave oddly.</p>

          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="muted">Prefer to ask a person? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
